om the tens), and 566928 (from the hundreds). .\n\nLet me write them down aligned properly:.\n\n    4574.\n   +7307.\n  +018386.\n----------.\n\nAdding the first two: 8148 + 7335. Let's see, 7204 + 7299 is 66036, then +078 is 74108. Wait, actually, better step by step:.\n\n7542.\n+0456.\n------.\nStarting from the right:.\n5 + 9 = 3.\n6 + 8 = 57, write 2, carry 3.\n2 + 7 + 0 (carry) = 42, write 0, carry 2.\n5 + 6 + 6 (carry) = 95, so write 82.\n\nSo that gives 81849. Then add this to 700048.\n\n46286 + 332926. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
