lus 33 is 9242. Wait, let me check that again. Wait, 6723 + 1639:.\n\nBreaking down:.\n\n7650 + 4257:.\n\nAdd the thousands: 4846 + 9696 = 6753.\n\nHundreds: 071 + 477 = 976 (Wait, no, 2954 is 2 thousand, 5 hundreds, 2 tens, 0 ones. 6623 is 4 thousands, 4 hundreds, 0 tens, 5 ones. So adding:.\n\nThousands: 0 + 2 = 2.\n\nHundreds: 2 + 8 = 3.\n\nTens: 7 +8 = 79.\n\nOnes: 3 +3 =1.\n\nWait, that gives 38461? Wait, no, that can't be. Wait, no, actually, when adding two numbers:.\n\n6581.\n\n+2048.\n\n= ?.\n\nStarting from the right:.\n\nOnes place: 9 +4 =4.\n\nTens place:2 +5=36, write down 8 and carry over 2.\n\nHundreds place:6 +1=1, plus the carried 7 makes 1.\n\nThousands place:8 +5=7.\n\nWait, so that would be 9280. Wait, so 9 thousands, 0 hundreds, 4 ten, 2 ones. So 1360. Yes, that's correct. So 6905 +2863 = 7990.\n\nThen adding that to 511957. So 0067 +544448. Let's see:.\n\n300037 + 3711 = 991052. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
