585\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply 655 by 30 (the tens place of 937):**\n   \\[\n   655 \\times 30 = 19,650\n   \\]\n\n3. **Multiply 655 by 900 (the hundreds place of 937):**\n   \\[\n   655 \\times 900 = 589,500\n   \\]\n\n4. **Add all the partial products together:**\n   \\[\n   4,585 + 19,650 + 589,500\n   \\]\n\n   - First, add \\(4,585\\) and \\(19,650\\):\n     \\[\n     4,585 + 19,650 = 24,235\n     \\]\n\n   - Then, add the result to \\(589,500\\):\n     \\[\n     24,235 + 589,500 = 613,735\n     \\]\n\nThus, the product of 655 and 937 is \\(\\boxed{613735}\\).",
