957 \\times 8 = 7,\\!656 \\)\n\n3. **Sum the results:**\n   \\[\n   382,\\!800 + 76,\\!560 + 7,\\!656 = 467,\\!016\n   \\]\n\n**Verification using the standard algorithm:**\n- Multiply 957 by 8 (units place): \\( 957 \\times 8 = 7,\\!656 \\)\n- Multiply 957 by 80 (tens place, shifted left): \\( 957 \\times 80 = 76,\\!560 \\)\n- Multiply 957 by 400 (hundreds place, shifted left twice): \\( 957 \\times 400 = 382,\\!800 \\)\n- Add all partial products:  \n  \\( 7,\\!656 + 76,\\!560 + 382,\\!800 = 467,\\!016 \\)\n\n**Final Answer:**  \nThe product of 957 and 488 is \\(\\boxed{467016}\\).",
