= 20000\n  \\]\n  \\[\n  25 \\times 45 = 1125\n  \\]\n- Sum the terms:\n  \\[\n  560000 + 31500 = 591500\n  \\]\n  \\[\n  591500 + 20000 = 611500\n  \\]\n  \\[\n  611500 + 1125 = 612625\n  \\]\n\nAnother verification by factoring:\n- Express 725 and 845 as multiples of 5:\n  \\[\n  725 = 5 \\times 145 \\quad \\text{and} \\quad 845 = 5 \\times 169\n  \\]\n- Compute the product:\n  \\[\n  (5 \\times 145) \\times (5 \\times 169) = 25 \\times (145 \\times 169)\n  \\]\n- Calculate \\(145 \\times 169\\):\n  \\[\n  145 \\times 169 = 24505\n  \\]\n- Multiply by 25:\n  \\[\n  25 \\times 24505 = 612625\n  \\]\n\nAll methods confirm that the product of 725 and 845 is \\(\\boxed{612625}\\).",
