hem step by step.\n\nFirst, 7406 + 26,797. Let's see: 4137 + 21,785. Adding 5650 to 97,662. .\n\n00,759 + 7,617 = 07,521.\n\n01,635 + 377 = 13,832. Wait, that might be a better way. Alternatively, 16,088 +1,098. Let me do 46,032 + 7,688 is 51,795, plus 334 gives 93,386. Okay, so that's 55,250.\n\nNow add the last term: 39,029 + 891,997. .\n\n177,334 + 85,653 = 044,514. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
