483 by 5 (units place):\n   \\[\n   483 \\times 5 = 2415\n   \\]\n\n2. Multiply 483 by 50 (tens place):\n   \\[\n   483 \\times 50 = 24150\n   \\]\n\n3. Multiply 483 by 800 (hundreds place):\n   \\[\n   483 \\times 800 = 386400\n   \\]\n\n4. Add the results of the three multiplications:\n   \\[\n   2415 + 24150 + 386400\n   \\]\n\n   First, add 2415 and 24150:\n   \\[\n   2415 + 24150 = 26565\n   \\]\n\n   Then add the result to 386400:\n   \\[\n   26565 + 386400 = 412965\n   \\]\n\nThus, the product of 855 and 483 is \\(\\boxed{412965}\\).",
