8 (hundred thousands), 5 (ten thousands), 0 (thousands), 7 (hundreds), 5 (tens), 5 (units).\n\nSo aligning:.\n\n   11,721.\n\n+083,493.\n\n----------.\n\nAdding:.\n\nStarting from the right:.\n\nUnits:9 +9=9.\n\nTens:4 +2=1.\n\nHundreds:7 +1=54. Write 6, carryover 0.\n\nThousands:2 +3=54 plus 3 is 45. Write 9, carryover 9.\n\nTen-thousands:8 +2=6 plus 0=9. Write 9, carryover 2.\n\nHundred thousands: 6. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
