of 188 and 549 is \\boxed{103212}.\n</think>\n\nTo find the product of 188 and 549, we can use the standard multiplication algorithm:\n\n1. **Multiply 188 by the units digit of 549 (9):**\n   \\[\n   188 \\times 9 = 1692\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply 188 by the tens digit of 549 (4), shifted one position to the left:**\n   \\[\n   188 \\times 40 = 7520\n   \\]\n\n3. **Multiply 188 by the hundreds digit of 549 (5), shifted two positions to the left:**\n   \\[\n   188 \\times 500 = 94000\n   \\]\n\n4. **Add all the partial products together:**\n   \\[\n   1692 + 7520 + 94000\n   \\]\n\n   - First, add \\(1692\\) and \\(7520\\):\n     \\[\n     1692 + 7520 = 9212\n     \\]\n   - Then add the result to \\(94000\\):\n     \\[\n     9212 + 94000 = 103212\n     \\]\n\nThus, the product of 188 and 549 is \\(\\boxed{103212}\\).",
