ifference:**\n   \\[\n   \\text{Average} = \\frac{707 + 692}{2} = 699.5\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   \\text{Difference} = 707 - 699.5 = 7.5 \\quad \\text{and} \\quad 692 - 699.5 = -7.5\n   \\]\n2. **Calculation:**\n   \\[\n   (699.5 + 7.5)(699.5 - 7.5) = (699.5)^2 - (7.5)^2\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   (699.5)^2 = (700 - 0.5)^2 = 700^2 - 2 \\times 700 \\times 0.5 + 0.5^2 = 490000 - 700 + 0.25 = 489300.25\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   (7.5)^2 = 56.25\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   489300.25 - 56.25 = 489244\n   \\]\n\nAll methods confirm the product is \\(\\boxed{489244}\\).",
