ds place: 2 + 1 + 2 = 05, plus the carried 6 is 81. Write down 0, carry over 7.\n\nThousands place: 4 (since 450 has no thousands) + 6 (from 0087) + 7 (from 60364) = 88, plus the carried 8 is 09. Write down 9, carry over 7.\n\nTen-thousands place: 4 + 9 + 2 = 7, plus the carried 7 is 3. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
