78 and 622, we can use the difference of squares formula by recognizing that 578 and 622 can be expressed as \\(600 - 22\\) and \\(600 + 22\\) respectively. \n\nUsing the identity \\((a - b)(a + b) = a^2 - b^2\\):\n\n\\[\n(600 - 22)(600 + 22) = 600^2 - 22^2\n\\]\n\nCalculating each term separately:\n\n\\[\n600^2 = 360000\n\\]\n\\[\n22^2 = 484\n\\]\n\nSubtracting these results:\n\n\\[\n360000 - 484 = 359516\n\\]\n\nThus, the product of 578 and 622 is \\(\\boxed{359516}\\).",
