\n   \\[\n   \\begin{array}{r}\n     3786 \\\\\n   + 56790 \\\\\n   +504800 \\\\\n   \\hline\n     565376 \\\\\n   \\end{array}\n   \\]\n\nVerification using the distributive property:\n\\[\n631 \\times 896 = 631 \\times (900 - 4) = (631 \\times 900) - (631 \\times 4)\n\\]\n\\[\n631 \\times 900 = 567900 \\quad \\text{and} \\quad 631 \\times 4 = 2524\n\\]\n\\[\n567900 - 2524 = 565376\n\\]\n\nThus, the product of 631 and 896 is \\boxed{565376}.",
