637 + 4,087. Hmm, 32,696 + 4,557 is 74,471. Then 35,977 + 819: 39,375 + 147 = 39,949, then +14 is 62,058. Okay, so total is 10,987. So 615 × 18 = 35,027. Then multiply by 61 to get 595 × 344. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
