n     \\]\n     \\[\n     1784 \\times 100 = 178400\n     \\]\n\n   - Calculate \\(223 \\times 60\\):\n     \\[\n     223 \\times 60 = 223 \\times 6 \\times 10\n     \\]\n     \\[\n     223 \\times 6 = 1338 \\quad \\text{(since } 200 \\times 6 = 1200, \\, 20 \\times 6 = 120, \\, 3 \\times 6 = 18 \\text{)}\n     \\]\n     \\[\n     1338 \\times 10 = 13380\n     \\]\n\n3. Add the results of the two parts:\n   \\[\n   178400 + 13380 = 191780\n   \\]\n\nThus, the product of 223 and 860 is \\(\\boxed{191780}\\).",
