7 +4=5. So that gives 200. Then adding two zeros makes it 83969.\n\nNow I need to add all three partial products together:.\n\nFirst partial product: 849.\n\nSecond partial product: 50,567.\n\nThird partial product: 34,038.\n\nAdding them up step by step. Let's start with 299 + 68,318. .\n\n422 + 71,838: 99,042 + 711 is 34,939, then +77 is 85,161.\n\nThen add 95,478 to that. 46,666 + 38,284. Let's see, 46,527 + 23,448 = 84,858. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
