= 058. That's correct.\n\nTherefore, when we do the multiplication:.\n\nFirst, 7 (units) × 578 = 3077.\n\nSecond, 6 (tens) × 168 = 554 × 33 = 7585.\n\nThird, 0 (hundreds) × 681 = 953 × 882 = 586,586.\n\nAdding them all together: 6103 + 0896 + 742216.\n\nLet me compute that step by step.\n\nFirst, add 4495 + 0318:.\n\n4312 + 7809. Let's see:.\n\n7710 + 9125 = 6974.\n\n1605 + 356 = 0499.\n\nSo total is 7651.\n\nThen add that to 878,949.\n\n8299 + 480,171. Let's see:.\n\n862,724 + 8,666 = 907,087. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
