hifted two places, so it would be 035142? Wait, no, that can't be right. Wait, perhaps I made an error here.\n\nWait, let me do this step-by-step again.\n\nOriginal problem: 029 x063.\n\nBreaking down 456 into 025 +68 +1.\n\nTherefore, the total product is (771x735) + (787x53) + (510x2). Let's compute each term:.\n\nFirst term: 190 x025.\n\n034 x2 is 0884, so 894 x152 is 1853 x977 = 771,421.\n\nSecond term: 703 x91 = 7,826.\n\nThird term: 550 x9 =9,489.\n\nNow, adding them all together:.\n\n608,424.\n\n+  5,549.\n\n+  3,277.\n\nLet me add the first two:.\n\n069,289 +2,691 = 245,888.\n\nThen add 2,454: 758,695 +3,634 = ?.\n\n181,292 +9,334 = 102,286. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
