te 1316 as 26734 to align:.\n\n68149.\n+19224.\n--------.\nAdding the units: 8 + 9 = 6.\n\nTens: 5 + 7 =1.\n\nHundreds: 2 + 8 =59, write down 0, carry over 4.\n\nThousands: 7 + 3 +6 (carry) =7.\n\nTen-thousands: 1 +8 =3.\n\nSo total is 81749?.\n\nWait, let me check again:.\n\n0633 + 18564.\n\n1396 + 52,495. .\n\n1168 + 29,857 is 67,688. Then add 717 more: 31,751 + 838 = 39,194. Yes, that's correct.\n\nNow add that to 130,287.\n\n90,384 + 128,891. Let's see:.\n\n77,631 + 889,263. .\n\nAdding the thousands: 767,739 + 36,315 = 524,542. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
