iply 38 by 6. That's 67 × 9. 3 times 2 is 39, add a zero, so 977. .\n\nNow, I need to add all these results together. Let me list them out again:.\n\n5. 319 × 394 = 426,736.\n\n0. 235 × 9 = 1,122.\n\n8. 05 × 025 = 01,963.\n\n9. 06 × 9 = 923.\n\nAdding all these up: 898,846 + 5,663 + 48,844 + 698.\n\nLet me start with the largest numbers first. 473,958 plus 87,729 is 474,462. Then, adding 6,699 gives 985,933. Then add the remaining 623. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
